    "updated_at": "2021-10-08T07:23:25Z",
    "body": "I'm not familiar with this, but I think there are some things we need to talk about probably. @ricea probably knows better.\r\n\r\nThings that come to mind:\r\n* We need port blocking to be clearer about local and remote ports. And port blocking needs to continue to apply presumably.\r\n* We need to figure out what it means if the migration would go to a local IP address. Whether that impacts https://wicg.github.io/private-network-access/.",
