    "updated_at": "2021-10-08T08:47:48Z",
    "body": "Interesting. I agree with @annevk's points. Port blocking needs to apply, or it would be a straightforward bypass. It's tricky because it happens at a different abstraction layer.\r\n\r\nMaybe private network access is not a problem because it would need cooperation between the private network server and the public network server to do the migration? It would still be a weird loophole, even if it turns out to be benign.\r\n\r\nI can't think of any other concerns right now.",
